From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:47:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 43/45] inkling2: fp8 KV cache for the global layers behind
 TF_INKLING2_KV

Keys and values of the global layers can be stored as e4m3 with an fp32
scale a token and key head, dequantised to bf16 at tile load. Sliding
layers stay bf16, and bf16 stays the default.
